{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "63425ab3-975b-4527-979c-47e04731c5c5",
        "name": "AQDI — Contract Multi Units (step5 + changes)",
        "description": "# Multi-unit contracts\n\n## What changed\n- New table: `contract_units` (`contract_id`, `real_unit_id`, `real_estate_id`)\n- `POST /api/v2/contract/step5` accepts one or more units\n- Unit details are stored in `real_units`, NOT copied into `contracts` columns\n- Contract show / admin detail return `units[]`\n\n## Auth\nSet collection variables:\n- `baseUrl` e.g. `https://your-domain.com`\n- `token` user Bearer token (Sanctum)\n- `contract_id`, `contract_uuid`, `real_estate_id`, `unit_id`\n\n## Step5 body shapes\n1. `units: [ {...}, {...} ]` create multiple\n2. `unit_ids: [10,11]` attach existing\n3. mix `units: [{unit_id:10}, {...new}]`\n4. legacy flat single-unit fields (still supported)",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://localhost"
        },
        {
            "key": "token",
            "value": ""
        },
        {
            "key": "contract_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "contract_uuid",
            "value": ""
        },
        {
            "key": "real_estate_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "unit_id",
            "value": "1"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "1) Contract start",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Start contract (optional real + unit)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v2/contract/start",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v2",
                                "contract",
                                "start"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"contract_type\": \"housing\",\n    \"instrument_type\": \"old_handwritten\",\n    \"is_real\": true,\n    \"real_id\": \"{{real_estate_id}}\",\n    \"real_units_id\": \"{{unit_id}}\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "description": "Creates contract.\nIf real_units_id is sent, it is also attached in contract_units.\nResponse: contract_id + uuid."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Start contract (no unit yet)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v2/contract/start",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v2",
                                "contract",
                                "start"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"contract_type\": \"housing\",\n    \"instrument_type\": \"old_handwritten\",\n    \"is_real\": false\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
